Package: argon-oneup-battery
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Playx <playx@argon-oneup.local>
Section: hardware
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/argon40tech/argon-oneup
Depends: dkms, device-tree-compiler, i2c-tools
Recommends: linux-headers-rpi-2712 | linux-headers-raspi | linux-headers-arm64 | linux-headers-rpi-v8 | linux-headers-generic, lm-sensors
Description: Argon ONE UP Laptop Battery & Power Management Driver
 Native Linux kernel power_supply driver for the Cellwise CW2217
 fuel gauge IC on the Argon ONE UP Raspberry Pi CM5 laptop.
 Exposes BAT0 (percentage, voltage, real current, temperature,
 dynamic battery runtime) and AC0 (online status) to the desktop
 environment (KDE Plasma, UPower, systemd-logind).
 Includes DKMS automatic build, Device Tree overlay, and config.txt auto-configuration.
